{"henry":{"portrait":"AIT20260915201224ODGXE91N-转换参考图的画风为2D中世纪游戏资产风格手绘插画，纯白背景-1_2.png","moods":[],"avatarCrop":{"cx":0.46944444444444444,"cy":0.09711914062499998,"size":0.2599999999999999}},"npcs":[{"id":"farmer_hello","name":"狗剩","gender":"男","identity":"村口的农夫","portrait":"AIT20260915201609RIZILDWM-转换参考图的画风为2D中世纪游戏资产风格手绘插画，纯白背景-1.png","avatar":"","moods":[],"graph":{"nodes":[{"id":"s","type":"start","x":40,"y":80},{"id":"c_talk","type":"condition","x":280,"y":80,"cond":"talked","condValue":"@SELF","text":""},{"id":"n_back","type":"npc","x":540,"y":20,"text":"又是你。这片果树往后是我的。苹果还在树上，你别打主意。"},{"id":"e_back","type":"end","x":840,"y":20},{"id":"n1","type":"npc","x":540,"y":200,"text":"你谁啊？西北这片果树，先锋部队过了以后就是我的。瓦拉几亚的地，该瓦拉几亚人来摘。"},{"id":"n2","type":"npc","x":820,"y":200,"text":"本地的早该让开。你要是也从瓦拉几亚来，就报个名。眼睛别往苹果上瞟。"},{"id":"ch","type":"choice","x":1100,"y":180,"text":"","options":[{"id":"o1","text":"我是{名}，也是来讨生活的。","check":"speech","dc":1},{"id":"o2","text":"树不是你种的。"},{"id":"o3","text":"我走了。"}]},{"id":"n_ok","type":"npc","x":1400,"y":40,"text":"哼。那你路过的时候把手擦干净。别挡着我的树，也别让我看见你跟艾尔登人搅在一起。"},{"id":"e_ok","type":"end","x":1700,"y":40},{"id":"n_bad","type":"npc","x":1400,"y":200,"text":"你眼睛在躲。我记住这张脸了。守卫队长要是问，我可会说。"},{"id":"e_bad","type":"end","x":1700,"y":200},{"id":"n_no","type":"npc","x":1400,"y":360,"text":"现在是我的。你再嘴硬，我就喊人。这些果子，一颗都不许你碰。"},{"id":"e_no","type":"end","x":1700,"y":360},{"id":"n_bye","type":"npc","x":1400,"y":500,"text":"走。走远点。我还要看着，别让别人先摘了。"},{"id":"e_bye","type":"end","x":1700,"y":500}],"connections":[{"from":"s","to":"c_talk","port":"out"},{"from":"c_talk","to":"n_back","port":"yes"},{"from":"n_back","to":"e_back","port":"out"},{"from":"c_talk","to":"n1","port":"no"},{"from":"n1","to":"n2","port":"out"},{"from":"n2","to":"ch","port":"out"},{"from":"ch","to":"n_ok","port":"o1"},{"from":"ch","to":"n_bad","port":"o1_fail"},{"from":"ch","to":"n_no","port":"o2"},{"from":"ch","to":"n_bye","port":"o3"},{"from":"n_ok","to":"e_ok","port":"out"},{"from":"n_bad","to":"e_bad","port